          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "le sourcil is inherited from Latin supercilium \"eyebrow\" (EtymDB), built from super \"above\" and cilium \"eyelid\" (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
